  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>neighbor-search-grid-positions · 10×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 2560 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-local-outlier-factor-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"81\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"4\"></rect><rect x=\"101\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"5\"></rect><rect x=\"121\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"6\"></rect><rect x=\"141\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"7\"></rect><rect x=\"161\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"8\"></rect><rect x=\"181\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"9\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-local-outlier-factor-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const gridPositionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; gridPositions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const COLUMNS: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const ROWS: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">const CELL_COUNT: u32 = 1024u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const CELL_MARGIN: f32 = 1.0009765625;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const TARGET_WORDS: u32 = 3u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">struct Lattice {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  valid: bool,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  bounded: bool,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  minimumX: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  minimumY: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  maximumX: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  maximumY: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  cellWidth: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  cellHeight: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  columns: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  rows: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  radius: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  radiusSquared: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  radiusDegrees: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  periodic: bool\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">fn readParameter(slot: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  return parameters[parametersOffset + slot];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">fn readLattice() -&gt; Lattice {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  var lattice: Lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  lattice.cellWidth = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  lattice.cellHeight = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  lattice.columns = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  lattice.rows = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  lattice.bounded = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  lattice.radiusDegrees = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  lattice.periodic = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let minimumX = readParameter(0u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let minimumY = readParameter(1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let maximumX = readParameter(2u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let maximumY = readParameter(3u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  let radius = readParameter(4u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  let width = maximumX - minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  let height = maximumY - minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  let radiusSquared = radius * radius;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  lattice.minimumX = minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  lattice.minimumY = minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  lattice.maximumX = maximumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  lattice.maximumY = maximumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  lattice.radius = radius;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  lattice.radiusSquared = radiusSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  lattice.valid =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    isFiniteFloat(minimumX) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(minimumY) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(maximumX) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    isFiniteFloat(maximumY) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(width) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(height) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">    width &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; height &gt;= 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  if (!lattice.valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    return lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  lattice.cellWidth = select(1.0, width / f32(COLUMNS), width &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  lattice.cellHeight = select(1.0, height / f32(ROWS), height &gt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  lattice.columns = COLUMNS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  lattice.rows = ROWS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  lattice.bounded = isFiniteFloat(radius) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(radiusSquared) &amp;&amp; radius &gt; 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  return lattice;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">// Finite and inside the bounds, independent of whether the radius or bounds form a usable lattice.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">fn isPointInBounds(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  return isFiniteFloat(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(y) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    x &gt;= lattice.minimumX &amp;&amp; x &lt;= lattice.maximumX &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    y &gt;= lattice.minimumY &amp;&amp; y &lt;= lattice.maximumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">fn isPointValid(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  return lattice.valid &amp;&amp; isPointInBounds(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">// A cross-join query. Planar queries need only finite coordinates: the cell lookups clamp to the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">// lattice and every cell bound below is measured from the true position, so a query outside the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">// bounds still finds its exact neighbors. Great-circle queries keep the bounds rule, because the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">// longitude wrap is defined by them.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">fn isCrossJoinQueryInBounds(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  return isFiniteFloat(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">fn isCrossJoinQueryValid(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  return lattice.valid &amp;&amp; isCrossJoinQueryInBounds(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">// Both clamp a position outside the lattice (a planar cross-join query) to the nearest edge cell.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">fn getCellColumn(lattice: Lattice, x: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  return u32(clamp(floor((x - lattice.minimumX) / lattice.cellWidth), 0.0, f32(lattice.columns - 1u)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">fn getCellRow(lattice: Lattice, y: f32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  return u32(clamp(floor((y - lattice.minimumY) / lattice.cellHeight), 0.0, f32(lattice.rows - 1u)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">// Distance along one axis from position (in cell queryCell) to the near edge of cell; zero\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">// for the query cell itself. A lower bound of the distance to any point of that cell, up to the\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">// rounding slack the callers subtract.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">fn getAxisGap(position: f32, minimum: f32, cellSize: f32, queryCell: i32, cell: i32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  if (cell &lt; queryCell) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">    return position - (minimum + f32(cell + 1) * cellSize);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  if (cell &gt; queryCell) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">    return (minimum + f32(cell) * cellSize) - position;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">fn getGridUnitPosition(lattice: Lattice, x: f32, y: f32) -&gt; vec2f {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  let width = max(lattice.maximumX, lattice.minimumX + lattice.cellWidth * f32(COLUMNS)) - lattice.minimumX;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  let height = max(lattice.maximumY, lattice.minimumY + lattice.cellHeight * f32(ROWS)) - lattice.minimumY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  return vec2f((x - lattice.minimumX) / width, (y - lattice.minimumY) / height);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"140\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"141\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">  _ = &amp;gridPositions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  let lattice = readLattice();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">  let x = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  let y = positions[positionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  let included = true &amp;&amp; isPointValid(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">  let invalid = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">  let unit = getGridUnitPosition(lattice, x, y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">  gridPositions[gridPositionsOffset + index * 2u] = select(invalid, unit.x, included);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">  gridPositions[gridPositionsOffset + index * 2u + 1u] = select(invalid, unit.y, included);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"observations\">observations</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"searchParameters\">searchParameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>gridPositions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"neighbor-search-grid-positions\">neighbor-search-grid-positions</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUNeighborSearch/grid-positions · main · 0dcee2ff</figcaption></figure></section>",
